# CHSH / Tsirelson null hardening (2026-08-03)

## Formula

$$B(r) = 2\sqrt{1 + \tanh^2(2r)}$$

Tsirelson bound $2\sqrt{2}$ = **2.8284271247**
Classical CHSH bound = **2.0**

